@Launcher_APP_BINARY_NAME@(6)


# NAME

@Launcher_APP_BINARY_NAME@ - a launcher and instance manager for Minecraft.


# SYNOPSIS

*@Launcher_APP_BINARY_NAME@* [OPTIONS...]


# DESCRIPTION

Meowncher is a custom launcher for Minecraft that allows you to easily manage
multiple installations of Minecraft at once. It also allows you to easily
install and remove mods by simply dragging and dropping.

Meowncher is designed to be reliable, easy to use, and cozy.

# OPTIONS

*-d, --dir*=DIRECTORY
	Use DIRECTORY as the Meowncher root.

*-l, --launch*=INSTANCE_ID
	Launch the instance specified by INSTANCE_ID.

*--show*=INSTANCE_ID
	Show the configuration window of the instance specified by INSTANCE_ID.

# ABOUT

Meowncher is an improved fork of the Prism Launcher. It maintains compatibility
with existing instances and features while providing a modernized interface
and improved user experience.

For more information, visit the official repository.
